        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our customer-first strategy, we are focused on customer success and offer several programs to help our customers maximize their success with our product offerings.",
        "start_character": 33941,
        "end_character": 34115
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
        "accession_number": "0001660134-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we add new customers, users, developers and integrations to our platforms, our business, customers, partners and users benefit from powerful network effects that increase the value and security of our solutions.",
        "start_character": 3118,
        "end_character": 3332
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
        "accession_number": "0001660134-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our professional services team provides assistance to customers in the deployment of our Okta Platform and Auth0 Platform and includes identity and security experts, customized deployment plans, SmartStart, which provides a quick path to implementation, and Okta Expert Assist, in which we provide our customers with recommendations and best practices designed to improve their security posture.",
        "start_character": 34776,
        "end_character": 35171
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
        "accession_number": "0001660134-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer a self-service approach for developers to sign up for free trials, free plans, paid developer plans of our Auth0 Platform, which may transition to paid enterprise plans that include more fulsome offerings.",
        "start_character": 30258,
        "end_character": 30477
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
        "accession_number": "0001660134-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are expanding these capabilities to include AI agents with the introduction of new product offerings currently in development and early access.",
        "start_character": 2420,
        "end_character": 2566
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
        "accession_number": "0001660134-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We employ a SaaS business model and generate revenue primarily by selling multi-year subscriptions to our cloud-based offerings.",
        "start_character": 3933,
        "end_character": 4061
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
        "accession_number": "0001660134-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect this to be particularly true as we are a cloud-based offering, and our competitors may also seek to acquire new offerings or repurpose their existing offerings to provide identity management solutions with subscription models.",
        "start_character": 39011,
        "end_character": 39247
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
        "accession_number": "0001660134-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We plan to further leverage the sales efforts of global system integrators, managed service providers, technology partners and other distribution partners for growth, scale and specialized expertise.",
        "start_character": 10445,
        "end_character": 10644
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
        "accession_number": "0001660134-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our product offerings directly through our field and inside sales teams, as well as indirectly through our network of channel partners, including cloud marketplaces, resellers, system integrators, and other distribution partners.",
        "start_character": 4380,
        "end_character": 4617
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
        "accession_number": "0001660134-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We strive to further increase revenue from our existing customers by cross-selling and up-selling additional and new product offerings.",
        "start_character": 9680,
        "end_character": 9815
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001660134-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001660134-26-000020-70172a34f685b1c1",
